{"id":"n16610-1-7","stage":2,"title":"서부 · 西部","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16610-1-7-1","ko":"동부는 날씨가 좋은데 서부는 어때요?","zh":"东部的天气很好，西部怎么样呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동부는","meaning":"东部，东","explanation":"동부：东部，东；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"동부","audio":"/audio/102b4c343f8fe9f31934.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14805","senseId":"1","lemma":"동부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동부는","audio":"/audio/3cd0213a33d36e629c72.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은데","meaning":"好，晴朗，明媚","explanation":"좋다：好，晴朗，明媚；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"6","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은데","audio":"/audio/96fb04b50f6bafca1589.mp3"}},{"text":"서부는","meaning":"西部","explanation":"서부：西部；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"서부","audio":"/audio/e8355f2697d47d9d9aae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16610","senseId":"1","lemma":"서부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서부는","audio":"/audio/10e53a24d240b661aa57.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"102b4c343f8fe9f3","term":"동부","zh":"东部，东","audio":"/audio/102b4c343f8fe9f31934.mp3","entryId":"14805","definition":"某地区的东边部分。","pronunciation":["동부"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term"